      SUBROUTINE BSWAP(K1,K2,IP)
      IMPLICIT NONE
C     =========================
C
C     Image plate version
C---- Moves I*2 words K1:K2 from IMAGE in /PEL/ to IDUM in /PRO/
C     starting at IP in IDUM
