C
C     .. Scalars in Common /CCONDATA/ ..
      CHARACTER GENFILE*200,CCFILE*200,ODEXT*8,WAXFN*134,
     +     GTITLE*80,IDENT*40,NEWMATNAM*200,MTZNAM*200,MTZDIR*200,
