C                of origin. This is used when called from CENTRS.
C           = 1  Need to find significant next peak on both sides
C                of origin. This is used when called for standard profiles.
C
C     NRXMIN   Minimum value of the X background rim to be considered
C              when optimising the raster box parameters to avoid 
C              including peaks of adjacent reflections. Returned.
C     NRYMIN, NCMIN as NRXMIN for other raster box parameters.
