     $     HBIAS,SUMBYTES,HUNDER,HDATEC,HCUTOFF,HPRCUTOFF,HHEAD
      LOGICAL USEHDR,USETAIL,USEDIST,USEWAVE,USEPHI,HDRSIZE,TESTDATE
