 6096 FORMAT(/,1X,'LARGE ERROR IN YSCALE PARAMETER',
     +       /,1X,'===============================',/,1X,
     +       'YSCALE differs from the default value by a maximum of',
     +       F8.4,/,1X,
     +       'YSCALE allows for the pixels in the detector not being',
     +       ' square.',/,1X,'However, all detectors except the ',
     +       'R-axis IV and HTC do have square pixels and so',/,1X,
     +       'YSCALE should be 1.000.',
