 6104 FORMAT(/,/,1X,'POOR PROFILES IN SOME AREAS',/,1X,
     =              '===========================',/,1X,
     +          'For',I4,' profiles the correlation coefficient ',
     +          'with the central profile is',/,1X,
     +          'less than 0.5.',/,1X,
     +          'Smallest correlation coefficient is',F6.2,/,1X,
     +          'Possible reasons are:',/,1X,
     +          '1) Very weak diffraction (consider cutting back',
     +          ' the resolution)',/,1X,
     +          '2) Errors in cell parameters (check DELX, DELY for',
