     +         'A low correlation does NOT necessarily mean that the',
     +         ' processing needs to be changed.',/,/,1X,
     +         'The image number, profile box number and correlation',
     +          ' coefficient for',/,1X,'up to the first 6',
     +          ' occurences are:',/,1X,4('     ID BOX CORRLN   ')
