     +           'the measurement box parameters',/,1X,'(Corner cutoff'
     +           ' NC, Border width',
     +           ' NRX, Border height NRY)',/,1X,
     +           ' has not worked correctly.',/,1X,
     +           'This will have a serious effect on the integration.'
     +           ,/,1X,
     +           'To correct this try the following in order:',/,1X,
     +           '1. Increase the profile tolerances.',/,4X,
     +           '(Settings->Processing options->Advanced Integration)'
     +           ,/,4X,'Do not exceed values of 0.08.'/,4X,
     +           'Before repeating the integration, ensure that the ',
     +           'measurement',/,4X,'box parameters are appropriate.',
     +           ' NRX and NRY should be set',/,4X,'so that the size',
     +           ' of the peak region (Box width-2*NRX), ',
     +           '(Box height-2*NRY)',/,4X,
     +           'matches the size of the average spot profile ',
     +           '(in pixels).',/,4X,'Set the values for Box width ',
     +           'NRX and Box height NRY',
     +           ' in:',/,4X,'(Settings->Processing options->Advanced',
     +           ' Integration)',/,
     +           /,1X,'2. If (1) fails, turn off',
     +           ' "Optimise parameters for central profiles"',/,4X,
     +           '(Settings->Processing options->Advanced Integration)'
     +           /,4X,'Set measurement box parameters as described in',
     +           ' (1) above.')
 6120     FORMAT(/,1X,'ADJACENT SPOTS ARE NOT FULLY RESOLVED',
     +          /,1X,'=====================================',
     +                /,1X,'The peak region of some standard ',
     +           'profiles appears to ',
     +           'include part',/,1X,'of an adjacent spot for',F5.1,
     +           '% of the profiles.',/,1X,
     +           'A list of the block numbers',
     +           ' and up to 9 of the affected profiles is',/,1X,
     +           'given below and can be used to check the profiles',
     +           ' in the iMosflm display.',/,1X,
     +    'First check that the predicted spot positions match the',
     +    ' diffraction pattern. If',/,1X,'they do, this suggests ',
