     +   'NRY) has not worked correctly. Examination of the profiles',
     +   ' should make it',/,1X,'possible to distinguish these.',//,1x,
     +   'This can have a significant effect on data quality that ',
     +   'will not necessarily',/,1X,'be apparent from the merging ',
     +   'statistics (symmetry related reflections will have',/,1X,
     +   'the same systematic error). Re-collecting the data with ',
     +   'improved spot separation',/,1X,'is the best solution.',
     +    //,1X,'If it is thought that the optimisation of ',
     +           'the measurement box parameters',/,1X,'(Corner cutoff'
     +           ' NC, Border width',
     +           ' NRX, Border height NRY)',/,1X,
     +           'has not worked correctly,'
     +           'try the following steps in order:',/,1X,
     +           '1. Increase the profile tolerances (current values',
     +           2F5.2,').',/,4X,
     +           '(Settings->Processing options->Advanced Integration)'
     +           ,/,4X,'Do not exceed values of 0.08.'/,4X,
     +           'Before repeating the integration, ensure that the ',
     +           'measurement',/,4X,'box parameters are appropriate.',
     +           ' NRX and NRY should be set',/,4X,'so that the size',
     +           ' of the peak region (Box width-2*NRX), ',
     +           '(Box height-2*NRY)',/,4X,
     +           'matches the size of the average spot profile ',
     +           '(in pixels).',/,4X,'Set the values for Box width ',
     +           'NRX and Box height NRY',
     +           ' in:',/,4X,'(Settings->Processing options->Advanced',
     +           ' Integration)',/,
     +           /,1X,'2. If (1) fails, turn off',
     +           ' "Optimise parameters for central profiles"',/,4X,
     +           '(Settings->Processing options->Advanced Integration)'
     +           /,4X,'Set measurement box parameters as described in',
     +           ' (1) above.',/,/,1X,'The affected profiles are ',
     +           'listed below, together with an estimate of how',/,1X,
     +          'serious the effect is. For each profile, the profile',
     +          ' value of a pixel that is',/,1X,'actually closer to',
     +          ' an adjacent spot is given, as a percentage of the ',
     +          'central',/,1X,'profile value. Any value above 10-20%',
     +          ' will give a significant error in the',/,1X,
     +         'integrated intensity.'//,1X,'*** Even if increasing the'
     +         ,' profile tolerance values makes this warning go',/,1X,
     +     'away, there will still be errors in the intensities. ***',/)
 6122     FORMAT(1X,'Block number  Profile numbers and ',
     +          'level of intrusion')
 6123     FORMAT(1x,I6,8X,10(I3,1X,I3,'%',1X))
 6124     FORMAT(/,1X,'SOME INCLUSION OF ADJACENT SPOTS IN STANDARD',
     +                ' PROFILES',/,1X,
     +                '==============================================='
     +                ,/,1X,'The peak region of some standard ',
     +           'profiles appears to ',
     +           'include a small part',/,1X,'of an adjacent spot for',
     +            F5.1,'% of the profiles.',/,1X,
     +           'A list of the block numbers',
     +           ' and up to 9 of the affected profiles is',/,1X,
     +           'given below and can be used to check the profiles',
     +           ' in the iMosflm display.',/,1X,
     +           'This suggests that the optimisation of ',
     +           'the measurement box parameters',/,1X,'(Corner cutoff'
     +           ' NC, Border width',
     +           ' NRX, Border height NRY)',/,1X,
     +           'has not worked correctly.',/,1X,'This might',
     +           ' have an effect on the integration.'
     +           ,/,1X,
     +           'To correct this try the following in order:',/,1X,
     +           '1. Increase the profile tolerances (current values',
     +           2F5.2,').',/,4X,
     +           '(Settings->Processing options->Advanced Integration)'
     +           ,/,4X,'Do not exceed values of 0.08.'/,4X,
     +           'Before repeating the integration, ensure that the ',
     +           'measurement',/,4X,'box parameters are appropriate.',
     +           ' NRX and NRY should be set',/,4X,'so that the size',
     +           ' of the peak region (Box width-2*NRX), ',
     +           '(Box height-2*NRY)',/,4X,
     +           'matches the size of the average spot profile ',
     +           '(in pixels).',/,4X,'Set the values for Box width ',
     +           'NRX and Box height NRY',
     +           ' in:',/,4X,'(Settings->Processing options->Advanced',
     +           ' Integration)',/,
     +           /,1X,'2. If (1) fails, turn off',
     +           ' "Optimise parameters for central profiles"',/,4X,
     +           '(Settings->Processing options->Advanced Integration)'
     +           /,4X,'Set measurement box parameters as described in',
     +           ' (1) above.',/,/,1X,'List of affected profiles:')
 6130     FORMAT(/,1X,'PROFILE TOLERANCE VALUES INCREASED',/,1X,
     +              '================================== ',/,1X,
     +              'The profile tolerance values have been increased',
     +              ' to',2F5.2,' to try to',/,1X,'reduce the ',
     +              'minimum spot separation to avoid too many ',
     +              'reflections being',/,1X,'flagged as overlapped')
 6132     FORMAT(/,1X,'LARGE NUMBER OF REFLECTIONS TOO WIDE IN PHI',/,
     +             1X,'===========================================',/,
     +            1X,'For some images,',I3,'% of the reflections are ',
     +            ' too wide in phi.',/,1X,'Consider increasing the ',
     +            'maximum reflection width (currently',F5.1,
     +            ' degrees) to reduce this.')
 6134     FORMAT(/,1X,'TOO LARGE A SHIFT IN CELL PARAMETERS',/,1X,
     +                '====================================',/,1X,
     +                'One of more cell parameters has changed by ',
     +                'more than 10%.',/,1X,'This could be because',
     +                ' the initial crystal to detector distance was',
     +                ' incorrect',/1X,'or the refinement is unstable',
     +                ' because the indexing has not worked and ',/,1X,
     +                'the predictions do not match the images or the',
