     +     ' pixels to that expected statistically',
     +     ' (the BGRATIO) lies outside the range',
     +     ' 0.7 to 1.3. Actual values: minimum:',F6.2,
     +     '  maximum:',F6.2,
     +     ' The most likely explanation is that the GAIN',
