     +     'constant, it should be worked out for a ',
     +     'crystal giving strong diffraction and clean ',
     +     'spots (ie no disorder or diffuse scatter)',
     +     'and kept at this value. Processing data with',
     +     ' an incorrect gain will result in a systematic ',
     +     'overestimate of very weak reflections and ',
     +     'incorrect standard deviations.</detail>',
     $     '<hint>change GAIN to ',F5.2,'</hint>',
     $     '</warning>')
